  (text "I2C addresses: inputs 0x20 / 0x27; lamps 0x21 / 0x22; EEPROM 0x50.\nPoll inputs at 1 ms and require 10 ms stable state (software debounce).\nSet lamp OLAT=0 before IODIR=outputs. Gate pull-downs keep lamps off at reset."
    (at 20 181 0)
    (effects
